  intro n F H C e q2 q4 g1 g2 a1 a2 o2 jM u1 u2 w1 w2 W2 z hFP hdist hH hF p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 p6 p7
    hmin hCF hga hg1 hg2 hre ha1 ha2 hr1 hr2 hu1 hu2 hoM hog ho hrq hM hro
